      "id": "sol.ahsme-1956-p9.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "For each of the two factors, the nested roots and outer fourth power multiply the exponent of \\(a\\) by \\[ 9\\cdot\\frac16\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot4=2. \\] Thus each factor is \\(a^2,\\) and their product is \\(a^2a^2=a^4.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D.",
      "hints": [
        "Replace each \\(n\\)th root by an exponent of \\(\\frac{1}{n}\\)",
        "Each bracket has exponent \\(9\\cdot\\frac16\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot4\\)"
      ],
